      + '<div class="qdb-set-row-ctl"><label class="qdb-check"><input type="checkbox" id="setImgMemOn"' + (on ? ' checked' : '') + '> 开启</label></div></div>'
      + '<div class="qdb-set-row"><div class="qdb-set-row-main"><p class="qdb-set-sub">相似阈值（汉明距离，0=必须完全一致，6=允许轻微差别）</p></div>'
      + '<div class="qdb-set-row-ctl"><input class="qdb-num" id="setImgMemDist" type="number" min="0" max="16" step="1" value="' + numText(dist) + '"></div></div>'
      + '<div class="qdb-set-row"><div class="qdb-set-row-main"><p class="qdb-set-sub">图库容量（超过后按「命中次数 + 最近使用」淘汰）</p></div>'
      + '<div class="qdb-set-row-ctl"><input class="qdb-num" id="setImgMemCap" type="number" min="100" max="50000" step="100" value="' + numText(cap) + '"></div></div>'
      + '<div class="qdb-set-row"><div class="qdb-set-row-main"><p class="qdb-set-sub">识图方式：图先转成文字再交给文本模型（关掉则沿用「切视觉模型」的老路）</p></div>'
      + '<div class="qdb-set-row-ctl"><label class="qdb-check"><input type="checkbox" id="setImgMemDescribeFirst"' + (descFirst ? ' checked' : '') + '> 先转述</label>'
